{"id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-signature.md","title":"Signature","display":"df-signature — Signature","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-signature","aliases":["92-df-signature"],"display":"df-signature — Signature","depends_on":[],"source":"第 II 章 pp. 14–16、20–25（PDF 31–33、37–42）","source_status":"本地有效重编码，非原书逐字语法"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-signature"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-signature</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-signature — Signature"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 II 章 pp. 14–16、20–25（PDF 31–33、37–42）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"本地有效重编码，非原书逐字语法"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-signature-—-Signature-$\\Sigma$\">df-signature — Signature <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(v_i)_{i\\in\\mathbb{N}}\">\\((v_i)_{i\\in\\mathbb{N}}\\)</span> (pairwise distinct variable-symbol tokens)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,S,+,\\cdot,=,\\neg,\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\forall,\\exists,\\mathtt{(},\\mathtt{)}\">\\(0,S,+,\\cdot,=,\\neg,\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\forall,\\exists,\\mathtt{(},\\mathtt{)}\\)</span> (pairwise distinct symbol tokens, disjoint from every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_i\">\\(v_i\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithSym}_G,\\mathrm{LogSym}_G,\\mathrm{Punct}_G,\\mathrm{Var}_G,\\Sigma_G\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithSym}_G,\\mathrm{LogSym}_G,\\mathrm{Punct}_G,\\mathrm{Var}_G,\\Sigma_G\\)</span> (definition-target sets)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}signature} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ArithSym}_G&amp;\\coloneqq\\{0,S,+,\\cdot,=\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{LogSym}_G&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\neg,\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\forall,\\exists\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Punct}_G&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathtt{(},\\mathtt{)}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Var}_G\\coloneqq\\{v_i\\mid i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma_G&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ArithSym}_G\\cup\\mathrm{LogSym}_G\\cup\\mathrm{Punct}_G\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_G.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}signature} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ArithSym}_G&amp;\\coloneqq\\{0,S,+,\\cdot,=\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{LogSym}_G&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\neg,\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\forall,\\exists\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Punct}_G&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathtt{(},\\mathtt{)}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Var}_G\\coloneqq\\{v_i\\mid i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma_G&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ArithSym}_G\\cup\\mathrm{LogSym}_G\\cup\\mathrm{Punct}_G\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_G.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_G\">\\(\\Sigma_G\\)</span> : 系统G的签名（符号集）</li>\n<li>算术符号：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>（零）、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>（后继）、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\">\\(+\\)</span>（加）、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot\">\\(\\cdot\\)</span>（乘）、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"=\">\\(=\\)</span>（等号）</li>\n<li>逻辑符号：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\">\\(\\neg\\)</span>（否定）、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\land\">\\(\\land\\)</span>（且）、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lor\">\\(\\lor\\)</span>（或）、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to\">\\(\\to\\)</span>（蕴涵）、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall/\\exists\">\\(\\forall/\\exists\\)</span>（量词）</li>\n<li>变量：可数无限</li>\n<li>括号属于表达式编码所用的辅助符号；项与公式采用全括号表示</li>\n<li>本文件中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,S,+,\\cdot,=\">\\(0,S,+,\\cdot,=\\)</span> 是语法 token；它们在结构中的语义由解释另行给出</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>现有签名把可数变量当作原始 token，并以素数幂编码串。原书用十三个基本符号，变量本身是有限串，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\land,\\lor,\\exists\">\\(\\land,\\lor,\\exists\\)</span> 是缩写；具体编码用十三进制，数码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> 的书中编码为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"13^n\">\\(13^n\\)</span>。本库有效重编码可用于标准不完备性重构，但不能声称复现原书的编码表或绕开替换算术化的具体证明。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 II 章 pp. 14–16、20–25（PDF 31–33、37–42）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-signature-—-Signature-$\\Sigma$","text":"df-signature — Signature $\\Sigma$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"(v_i)_{i\\in\\mathbb{N}}","display":false},{"tex":"0,S,+,\\cdot,=,\\neg,\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\forall,\\exists,\\mathtt{(},\\mathtt{)}","display":false},{"tex":"v_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithSym}_G,\\mathrm{LogSym}_G,\\mathrm{Punct}_G,\\mathrm{Var}_G,\\Sigma_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}signature} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ArithSym}_G&\\coloneqq\\{0,S,+,\\cdot,=\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{LogSym}_G&\\coloneqq\\{\\neg,\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\forall,\\exists\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Punct}_G&\\coloneqq\\{\\mathtt{(},\\mathtt{)}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Var}_G\\coloneqq\\{v_i\\mid i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma_G&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ArithSym}_G\\cup\\mathrm{LogSym}_G\\cup\\mathrm{Punct}_G\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_G.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_G","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"+","display":false},{"tex":"\\cdot","display":false},{"tex":"=","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg","display":false},{"